    {
      "id": "claim_4085824ea1844ffdb294dd29e4a831c9",
      "statement": "`validate()` checks the required seven-column EOD frame without raising: it reports contract errors for missing columns, non-numeric values, duplicate dates, negative values, and `High < Low`, while reporting sortable dates, unparseable dates, zero volume, NaNs, extra columns, and insufficient clean history as notes; `validate_or_raise()` raises only when that report has errors.",
